  "project_description": "Submodule of Eulerian that supplies the Eulerian JavaScript datalayer on the Commerce checkout 'complete' step. When the resolved checkout step for the routed order is 'complete', it adds the order reference (UUID), total amount, currency code and a products list (each product's UUID as ref, unit price as amount, quantity) to drupalSettings.eulerian.datalayer for conversion tracking. Requires the base eulerian module and commerce_checkout.",
